# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how a nuclear shell-model Hamiltonian, tabulated in a $J$-coupled basis of orbitals, becomes\n"
"a qubit Hamiltonian in the $m$-scheme, where one qubit is one single-particle state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelajari bagaimana Hamiltonian shell-model nuklir, yang ditabulasikan dalam basis orbital berpasangan-$J$, menjadi\n"
"Hamiltonian qubit dalam skema-$m$, di mana satu qubit mewakili satu keadaan partikel tunggal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a fixed, non-variational excitation ansatz whose angles come from second-order\n"
"perturbation theory, so there is no classical optimization loop.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bangun ansatz eksitasi tetap non-variasional yang sudutnya berasal dari teori perturbasi\n"
"orde kedua, jadi tidak ada loop optimisasi klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare qubit and fermionic excitations and measure how the choice affects the ensemble’s\n"
"two-qubit depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan eksitasi qubit dan eksitasi fermionik, lalu ukur bagaimana pilihan itu memengaruhi\n"
"kedalaman dua-qubit dari ensemble.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run self-consistent configuration recovery with `qiskit-addon-sqd` when the conserved\n"
"quantities are nucleon numbers, $M_J$, and parity rather than electron numbers and spin.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan pemulihan konfigurasi self-consistent dengan `qiskit-addon-sqd` ketika besaran\n"
"yang kekal adalah jumlah nukleon, $M_J$, dan paritas, bukan jumlah elektron dan spin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply one workflow from a 24-qubit problem you can check exactly to a 40-qubit problem\n"
"with nearly two million basis states, beyond this tutorial's exact-diagonalization capacity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terapkan satu workflow dari masalah 24-qubit yang bisa Anda cek secara eksak ke masalah 40-qubit\n"
"dengan hampir dua juta keadaan basis, di luar kapasitas diagonalisasi eksak tutorial ini.\n"

